  "description": "Martin Property Consultants is thrilled to present this stunning two-bedroom, top-floor apartment to rent in the highly sought-after Longmeadows Apartments! This beautifully presented 2-bedroom, 1-bathroom home offers modern living with both comfort and convenience.\n\nThe property comes fully furnished with stylish interiors, featuring a bright open-plan living and dining area and a fully equipped kitchen with all mod cons. Both double bedrooms include ample storage to maximize space and benefit from direct balcony access. The layout is well-designed with generously sized rooms, while floor-to-ceiling windows allow the apartment to soak up natural light and enjoy picturesque views of the River Liffey from the two large private balconies.\n\nThe property also includes one secure underground parking space. With its prime location close to Dublin city centre, excellent transport links, and a wealth of shops, cafés, and amenities nearby, this apartment is ideal for anyone seeking a vibrant yet comfortable home.\n\nViewings highly recommended!\n\n**To arrange a viewing please enquire through the advertisement**",
